## Supported Versions

| Version | Supported |
|---------|-----------|
| `<supported version>` | Yes |
| `<unsupported version>` | No |

## Scope

In scope: code and configuration in this repository. Third-party
vulnerabilities caused by this repository's selected version, pin,
configuration, permissions, or integration also remain in scope. Route
defects that are purely upstream to the upstream maintainers.

Out of scope: social engineering and physical attacks.

## Reporting a Vulnerability

Report vulnerabilities through GitHub's private vulnerability reporting
(Security tab, Report a vulnerability). Do not open a public issue for a
vulnerability report.

Response timing: `<acknowledgment target>`.

Remediation target: `<remediation target>`.

## Disclosure Policy

Use coordinated disclosure with the maintainers. Keep the report private
until a fix ships or `<disclosure deadline>` passes, whichever comes
first.
